# 2025-07-12 11:03:37.667824
+can we implement these extra fucntions? Please add the following features to my legal document filling web app (React frontend, Node.js/Express backend):
+
+1. **Real-Time Compliance Checks**:  
+   - Integrate an AI or rules-based compliance checker that validates user inputs against up-to-date legal regulations as forms are filled.
+   - Highlight non-compliant entries and suggest corrections in real time.
+   - Recommend a method to keep regulatory data current (e.g., API integration or scheduled updates).
+
+2. **Natural Language Input**:  
+   - Allow users to describe their legal needs in plain English.
+   - Use an LLM to parse the input and pre-fill relevant form fields.
+   - Show how to map the parsed data to the form structure.
+
+3. **Automated Review & Suggestions**:  
+   - After form completion, use AI to review the document for missing data, inconsistencies, or risky clauses.
+   - Provide instant feedback and highlight issues in the UI.
+
+4. **E-signature Integration**:  
+   - Integrate with an e-signature provider (DocuSign, Adobe Sign, or HelloSign).
+   - Add endpoints and UI to trigger the e-signature workflow.
+   - Handle signature status updates via webhooks.
+
+5. **Template Personalization**:  
+   - Use AI to recommend or adapt document templates based on user profile and past activity.
+   - Implement logic for dynamic template selection and modification.
+
+For each feature, generate backend and frontend code (where relevant), specify any required libraries or APIs, and include comments explaining the logic.
+

